{"page":464,"width":1723,"height":2615,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"11.8 RAID 구조","words":[{"text":"11.8","x":1202,"y":161,"width":63,"height":23},{"text":"RAID","x":1283,"y":162,"width":61,"height":22},{"text":"구조","x":1354,"y":161,"width":46,"height":24}]},{"text":"525","words":[{"text":"525","x":1472,"y":156,"width":59,"height":28}]},{"text":"• RAID는 드라이브의 가상 장치들을 통해 SAN의 내부연결 계층에 구현될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":304,"y":297,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"RAID는","x":344,"y":291,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"드라이브의","x":486,"y":289,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"가상","x":657,"y":290,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"장치들을","x":728,"y":290,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"통해","x":859,"y":291,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"SAN의","x":933,"y":290,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"내부연결","x":1054,"y":290,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"계층에","x":1193,"y":289,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"구현될","x":1301,"y":289,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1412,"y":289,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1460,"y":289,"width":70,"height":38}]},{"text":"이 경우 하나의 장지는 호스트들과 저장매체 사이에 위치한다. 장치는 서버들로부터","words":[{"text":"이","x":346,"y":350,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":392,"y":350,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"하나의","x":467,"y":350,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"장지는","x":575,"y":350,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"호스트들과","x":678,"y":351,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"저장매체","x":840,"y":351,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"사이에","x":973,"y":352,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"위치한다.","x":1079,"y":352,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"장치는","x":1226,"y":351,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"서버들로부터","x":1336,"y":350,"width":190,"height":38}]},{"text":"명령을 받고 저장매체로의 접근을 관리한다. 각 블록을 두 개의 다른 저장장치에 쓰","words":[{"text":"명령을","x":347,"y":410,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"받고","x":457,"y":410,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"저장매체로의","x":535,"y":411,"width":179,"height":37},{"text":"접근을","x":732,"y":411,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"관리한다.","x":832,"y":411,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":975,"y":412,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"블록을","x":1017,"y":413,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":1123,"y":414,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"개의","x":1169,"y":413,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1245,"y":412,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"저장장치에","x":1323,"y":412,"width":159,"height":37},{"text":"쓰","x":1498,"y":415,"width":32,"height":27}]},{"text":"는 예처럼 장지는 미러링을 제-공할수 있다.","words":[{"text":"는","x":345,"y":473,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"예처럼","x":392,"y":471,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"장지는","x":499,"y":471,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"미러링을","x":607,"y":472,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"제-공할수","x":739,"y":472,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":881,"y":472,"width":65,"height":37}]},{"text":"스냅숏(snapshot)이나 복제(replication)와 같은 다른 특징들이 상기의 계층에 역","words":[{"text":"스냅숏(snapshot)이나","x":347,"y":593,"width":331,"height":43},{"text":"복제(replication)와","x":691,"y":595,"width":279,"height":42},{"text":"같은","x":984,"y":596,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1057,"y":597,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"특징들이","x":1132,"y":597,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"상기의","x":1272,"y":596,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"계층에","x":1386,"y":596,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"역","x":1500,"y":597,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"시 구현될 수 있다. 스냅숏은 마지막 갱신이 일어나기 전의 파일 시스템의 모습이다. (스","words":[{"text":"시","x":285,"y":656,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"구현될","x":330,"y":655,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":441,"y":655,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":489,"y":654,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"스냅숏은","x":572,"y":656,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"마지막","x":708,"y":656,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"갱신이","x":811,"y":655,"width":84,"height":37},{"text":"일어나기","x":913,"y":657,"width":115,"height":37},{"text":"전의","x":1046,"y":658,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":1117,"y":658,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시스템의","x":1192,"y":657,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"모습이다.","x":1332,"y":658,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"(스","x":1485,"y":661,"width":45,"height":36}]},{"text":"냅숏은 14장에서 더 상세하게 다룬다). 복제는 중복성과 복구를 위해 자동으로 분리","words":[{"text":"냅숏은","x":286,"y":717,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"14장에서","x":403,"y":715,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"더","x":558,"y":717,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"상세하게","x":605,"y":717,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"다룬다).","x":747,"y":717,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"복제는","x":874,"y":717,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"중복성과","x":982,"y":719,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"복구를","x":1121,"y":719,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":1234,"y":719,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"자동으로","x":1314,"y":718,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"분리","x":1463,"y":720,"width":63,"height":35}]},{"text":"된 지역에 같은 내펑-을 쓰는 것이다. 복제방식은 동기적(synchronous) 혹은 비동기적","words":[{"text":"된","x":285,"y":778,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"지역에","x":334,"y":777,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":447,"y":777,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"내펑-을","x":526,"y":777,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"쓰는","x":633,"y":780,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":710,"y":778,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"복제방식은","x":821,"y":778,"width":152,"height":37},{"text":"동기적(synchronous)","x":985,"y":780,"width":319,"height":42},{"text":"혹은","x":1319,"y":780,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"비동기적","x":1401,"y":780,"width":125,"height":36}]},{"text":"(asynchronous)으로 할 수 있다. 동기적 복제의 경우 쓰기가 완료되었다고 판단되기","words":[{"text":"(asynchronous)으로","x":285,"y":840,"width":322,"height":40},{"text":"할","x":622,"y":839,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":668,"y":840,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":716,"y":839,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"동기적","x":798,"y":839,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"복제의","x":903,"y":840,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"경우","x":1011,"y":840,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"쓰기가","x":1084,"y":840,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"완료되었다고","x":1190,"y":840,"width":193,"height":36},{"text":"판단되기","x":1400,"y":840,"width":125,"height":37}]},{"text":"전에 각 블록은 로컬 영역과 원격 영역에 반드시 쓰여야 한다. 비동기적 복제는 써야 할","words":[{"text":"전에","x":286,"y":899,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":365,"y":899,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"블록은","x":410,"y":898,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"로컬","x":522,"y":899,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"영역과","x":601,"y":900,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"원격","x":705,"y":899,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"영역에","x":780,"y":900,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"반드시","x":881,"y":900,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"쓰여야","x":984,"y":901,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1087,"y":901,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"비동기적","x":1171,"y":901,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"복제는","x":1308,"y":901,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"써야","x":1419,"y":901,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1497,"y":901,"width":34,"height":35}]},{"text":"내용을 묶음으로 만들어 주기적으로 쓰게 된다. 비동기적 복제는 주된 사이트가 고장날","words":[{"text":"내용을","x":286,"y":959,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"묶음으로","x":398,"y":959,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"만들어","x":542,"y":960,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"주기적으로","x":650,"y":960,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"쓰게","x":817,"y":960,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":891,"y":961,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"비동기적","x":974,"y":961,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"복제는","x":1106,"y":961,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"주된","x":1212,"y":962,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"사이트가","x":1289,"y":961,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"고장날","x":1433,"y":961,"width":98,"height":35}]},{"text":"경우 데이터의 손실이 생길 수 있지만 빠르고 원격 영역의 거리에 제한받지 않는다. 데","words":[{"text":"경우","x":286,"y":1020,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"데이터의","x":366,"y":1019,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"손실이","x":510,"y":1020,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"생길","x":621,"y":1021,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":696,"y":1021,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있지만","x":742,"y":1020,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"빠르고","x":846,"y":1021,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"원격","x":951,"y":1021,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"영역의","x":1026,"y":1021,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"거리에","x":1129,"y":1022,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"제한받지","x":1235,"y":1021,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":1378,"y":1021,"width":105,"height":35},{"text":"데","x":1500,"y":1021,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"이터 센터 내에서 또는 심지어 호스트 내에서도 복제의 사용이 증가하고 있다. RAID 보","words":[{"text":"이터","x":287,"y":1080,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"센터","x":363,"y":1081,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"내에서","x":442,"y":1080,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"또는","x":549,"y":1083,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"심지어","x":625,"y":1081,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"호스트","x":727,"y":1083,"width":93,"height":28},{"text":"내에서도","x":832,"y":1081,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"복제의","x":963,"y":1081,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"사용이","x":1066,"y":1081,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"증가하고","x":1168,"y":1081,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1308,"y":1081,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"RAID","x":1391,"y":1083,"width":96,"height":28},{"text":"보","x":1500,"y":1083,"width":33,"height":26}]},{"text":"호의 대안으로 복제는 데이터 손실을 방지하고 읽기 성능을 향상한다(각 복제본 사본에","words":[{"text":"호의","x":285,"y":1141,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"대안으로","x":366,"y":1141,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"복제는","x":508,"y":1141,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":619,"y":1141,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"손실을","x":723,"y":1140,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"방지하고","x":829,"y":1141,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"읽기","x":966,"y":1141,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"성능을","x":1038,"y":1142,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"향상한다(각","x":1141,"y":1142,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"복제본","x":1322,"y":1140,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"사본에","x":1435,"y":1139,"width":95,"height":36}]},{"text":"서 읽기를 허용하기 때문에). 물론 대부분의 RAID 유형보다 더 많은 저장장치를 사우","words":[{"text":"서","x":286,"y":1201,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"읽기를","x":335,"y":1201,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"허용하기","x":447